{{!
    @template tool_vae/section_page

    The page that writes one section of one's own document, under its title, in one of three states: the contact details
    read from the account (a list of terms and values, the way to the profile, the way back); a section of separate fields
    (the help, where it stands, its history, the way back, the form); a section of free text (the conflict of a version
    refused, the notices of the document, the help, where it stands, its ways out, the situations tagged on the bloc, the form
    and the live region of the autosave).

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\section_page. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except these keys:
    * noticehtml - the notification of a conflict, drawn by the renderer of the core
    * taggedhtml - the situations tagged on the bloc, drawn by the template tool_vae/tagged_situations ('' when none)
    * formhtml - the form of the section, drawn by moodleform::render()

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * tool-vae-autosave (id) - the live region the module tool_vae/autosave writes in

    Context variables required for this template:
    * account - object or null: help (object: text) or null; rows, an array of {term, value}; profile and back (url, text)
    * fields - object or null: help (object: text) or null; status; history and back (url, text); formhtml
    * text - object or null: conflict (object: noticehtml, kept, reload and history (url, text)) or null; labelling (object:
      text) or null; reflexion (object: private, consigne, prompts) or null; help (object: text) or null; consigne (object:
      text) or null; status; history and back (url, text); taggedhtml; formhtml; autosaved (string, '' for none)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "account": {
            "help": {"text": "Read from your account."},
            "rows": [{"term": "Email address", "value": "camille@example.com"}],
            "profile": {"url": "https://example.com/user/edit.php?id=7", "text": "Edit my profile"},
            "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/faisabilite.php", "text": "Back to the list"}
        },
        "fields": {
            "help": null, "status": "No version yet.",
            "history": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/history.php?draftid=3", "text": "History"},
            "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/faisabilite.php", "text": "Back to the list"},
            "formhtml": "<form action=\"#\"></form>"
        },
        "text": {
            "conflict": {
                "noticehtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">Another tab saved this draft.</div>",
                "kept": "Your text is kept in the form below.",
                "reload": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/section.php?section=objectifs", "text": "Reload"},
                "history": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/history.php?draftid=3", "text": "History"}
            },
            "labelling": {"text": "Preparation - not the official dossier"},
            "reflexion": {"private": "Nobody else reads it.", "consigne": "Name nobody.", "prompts": "What did you learn?"},
            "help": {"text": "Say what you aim at."},
            "consigne": {"text": "Name nobody."},
            "status": "Current version: 2.",
            "history": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/history.php?draftid=3", "text": "History"},
            "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/faisabilite.php", "text": "Back to the list"},
            "taggedhtml": "",
            "formhtml": "<form action=\"#\"></form>",
            "autosaved": "Draft saved at 10:42."
        }
    }
}}
{{#account}}{{#help}}<p class="tool-vae-section-help">{{text}}</p>{{/help}}<dl class="row">{{#rows}}{{!
}}<dt class="col-sm-3">{{term}}</dt><dd class="col-sm-9">{{value}}</dd>{{/rows}}</dl>{{!
}}{{#profile}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/profile}}{{!
}}{{#back}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/back}}{{/account}}{{!
}}{{#fields}}{{#help}}<p class="tool-vae-section-help">{{text}}</p>{{/help}}<p>{{status}}</p>{{!
}}{{#history}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/history}}{{!
}}{{#back}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/back}}{{!
}}{{{formhtml}}}{{/fields}}{{!
}}{{#text}}{{#conflict}}{{{noticehtml}}}<p>{{kept}}</p>{{!
}}<p>{{#reload}}<a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a>{{/reload}} - {{!
}}{{#history}}<a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a>{{/history}}</p>{{/conflict}}{{!
}}{{#labelling}}<div class="alert alert-info tool-vae-labelling" role="note">{{text}}</div>{{/labelling}}{{!
}}{{#reflexion}}<div class="alert alert-info tool-vae-labelling" role="note">{{private}}</div>{{!
}}<div class="alert alert-warning tool-vae-anonymise" role="note">{{consigne}}</div>{{!
}}<p class="tool-vae-section-help">{{prompts}}</p>{{/reflexion}}{{!
}}{{#help}}<p class="tool-vae-section-help">{{text}}</p>{{/help}}{{!
}}{{#consigne}}<div class="alert alert-warning tool-vae-anonymise" role="note">{{text}}</div>{{/consigne}}{{!
}}<p>{{status}}</p>{{#history}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/history}}{{!
}}{{#back}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/back}}{{!
}}{{{taggedhtml}}}{{{formhtml}}}{{!
}}<div class="text-muted small" id="tool-vae-autosave" role="status" aria-live="polite">{{autosaved}}</div>{{/text}}
